  "about_app": "App-ka 'Aqim' waa app Islami oo fudud oo toos ah, oo si gaar ah loogu sameeyay si uu kaaga caawiyo inaad samaysid salaadaadka waqtigooda oo fudud.\nApp-ku waxa uu diiradda saaraa bixinta qalabka muhiimka ah ee ay Muslim walba u baahan tahay noloshiisa maalinlaha ah, iyada oo loo marayo interface-fudud oo isticmaal ah oo kuu dammaanad qaadaya khibrad raaxo leh oo cad.\n'Aqim', mar dambe ma lumin doontid sallaad, maxaa yeelay app-ku waxa uu u shaqeeyaa sida koor shakhsi ah iyo hage saxan oo Qibladdaada ah, taas oo ka dhigaysa qalabka ugu fiican ee lagu ilaaliyo tiirarka ugu muhiimsan ee Islaamka.",
  "@about_app": {
    "type": "text",
    "placeholders": {}
  },
  "about_app2": "Sifooyinka App-ka:",
  "@about_app2": {
    "type": "text",
    "placeholders": {}
  },
  "about_app3": "Waqtiyada Salaadda: App-ku waxa uu muujiyaa waqtiyada salaadda iyada oo leh saxnaad sare oo ku saleysan goobta juqraafiyeedka.\nOgeysiinta Adhaan: Hel digniino maqal ah marka waqtiga sallaad kasta yimaado si had iyo jeer u diyaar ahaato.\nJihada Qiblada: Kompas saxan oo fudud oo la isticmaalo si loo go'aamiyo jihada Qiblada saxda ah meel kasta oo adduunka ka mid ah.\nInterface Is-dhexgal: Naqshad fudud oo cad oo fududda u dhigaysa in la dhex maro sifooyinka app-ka iyada oo aan wax isku dhafan ah lahayn.",
  "@about_app3": {
    "type": "text",
    "placeholders": {}
  },
